:: Shelter Wake
Rain on corrugated iron. You wake on a cot in St. Jude's shelter, back aching. Match day.

Fat Keung's boys collected from two beds down last night — you heard the whole thing through the wall. You owe him $500,000. Fifty thousand of it is due tomorrow.

鐵皮屋頂的雨聲。你在聖猶大中心的帆布床上醒來。今日有波賽。你欠肥強五十萬，聽日要還五萬。

It's 6 AM. What do you do with your morning?

[[Trek to the training ground->Training Ground]]
[[Tea café gossip and breakfast->Tea Cafe]]
[[Sleep two more hours->Oversleep]]

:: Training Ground
You slip out into the drizzle at 6:15, an hour east to the wire fence behind Harbour FC's pitch. At 9:00 the squad jogs out.

The #9 — the striker the paper called "out of form" — is burying every finish, top corner, both feet. Whatever the paper says, this man is sharp.

主隊9號前鋒，報紙話狀態低迷，操射門隻隻入死角。呢條友狀態爆棚。

A kid in an oversized Harbour jacket collects stray balls by the fence. He clocks you watching.

[[Talk to the ball kid->Ball Kid]]
[[Head for the betting shop->Betting Shop]]

:: Ball Kid
"You bet, uncle?" he says. "Then you'll want to know — I do ball-boy for Eastport too. Their keeper was at the Golden Crown last night. My cousin works the bar. Says he was still ordering at 2 AM."

He didn't have to tell you that. Remember this kid.

「阿叔你賭波？東港隻門將琴晚飲到凌晨兩點。」佢冇必要話你知。記住呢個細路。

(set: $ballKidFavour to 1)
(set: $knowsKeeperDrunk to true)

[[Head for the betting shop->Betting Shop]]

:: Tea Cafe
Instant milk tea and a bun. The uncles argue over the form guide. Someone mutters that Harbour's #9 has been "lively in training" — but you can't tell if it's real or just talk.

茶餐廳奶茶配包。阿叔們嘈馬經。有人話主隊9號「操得幾生猛」——但你分唔到係真料定係吹水。

(set: $rumourOnly to true)

[[Head for the betting shop->Betting Shop]]

:: Oversleep
You pull the thin blanket up and sleep. When you wake it's nearly noon — no time to gather anything. Whatever you bet today, you bet blind.

你瞓返。醒返已經晏晝。今日落乜注都係盲賭。

[[Head for the betting shop->Betting Shop]]

:: Betting Shop
Lucky Star Betting. Smoke, radio static, old men arguing. The board still reads yesterday's paper:

Harbour 2.75 / Draw 3.10 / Eastport 2.20.

(if: $knowsKeeperDrunk is true)[You know what the board doesn't: a hot home striker AND a hungover away keeper. Harbour at 2.75 is value.]

幸運星投注站。賠率板仲照琴日份報紙開。

[[Bet Harbour to win->Bet Placed]]
[[Walk away, save your money->Bet Placed]]

